			description: [
				"It is &ahighly recommended&r that you &6play this pack using shaders&r, as it greatly enhances the ambience. The pack includes a few choices:"
				""
				"- &l&2Insanity Shaders&r: 想要营造恐怖氛围，这款着色器无人能及。毫无疑问，这是我的首选！"
				""
				"- &l&2Spooklementary&r：更暗、饱和度更高的选项，性能消耗也更低。妥妥的第二名。还会在黑暗中增加额外的眼睛。"
				""
